  "id": 1114,
  "description": "## Calmshore\nCalmshore is a casual, non-competitive guild with no strict contribution requirements.\n\nWe accept players who enjoy relaxed incremental gameplay and want access to basic guild activities and mechanics (raid, challenge, repair maintenance, energizing Pools bonus) without pressure.  \n\nWe expect members to participate or contribute at their own pace — every little bit helps.\n\nJoining Requirement: Combat Lv. 50\n\nDue to prolonged non-participation from past members, members are now required to participate in any guild activity at least once every 3 weeks.\n\nKick: After 4 days of profile inactivity or 3 weeks of guild inactivity.\nYou will be sent a final notice before being kicked.\n\nRaid: 2x Daily - Discord has role ping.  \nSkybound Eden (Combat Lv. 70) (55 Minutes) - Floating Gardens of Aetheria\n\n1st Raid: PST 6pm, CST 8pm, EST 9pm, UTC 1am, AWST 9am  \n2nd Raid: PST 7am, CST 9am, EST 10am, UTC 2pm, AWST 10pm\n\nEnergizing Pools activated on SAT &amp; SUN (America) / SUN &amp; MON (Eurasia) after 1st raid.  \nPST 6:55pm, CST 8:55pm, EST 9:55pm, (Sunday) UTC 1:55am, AWST 9:55am  \n\nOur Discord: https://discord.gg/Np2jQR4BCz\n\nCurrent Goal:  \nComplete Guild Challenges to afford weekly Guild Raids &amp; Energizing Pools  \nMaintain Repair Material in Stockpile\n\n[HISTORY]  \n20251212 Guild Established, transferred from &#039;Harem Kings&#039; Guild  \n20260207 Guild Lv. 60  \n20260323 Guild Lv. 70  \n20260403 Built Energizing Pools  \n20260608 Guild Lv. 80  \n20260803 Guild Lv. 85  \n\n### | GUILD BOARD |\n\n[GUILD MARKS]  \nEach completed Guild Challenge add 1 mark. A raid cost 3 marks &amp; Energizing Pools  cost 5 marks per activation.\n\n[CONTRIBUTION]  \nContribute at your own pace.  \n- Join a raid. (Lv. 70 raid rewards 2.1k gold, 23k Combat EXP, 25k Guild Mastery EXP)\n- Contribute to Guild Challenge. We appreciate all the help we can get.\n- Deposit to Stockpile to repair guild components as soon as possible to save cost.\n\n[REPAIR &amp; STOCKPILE]  \nGuild components are best repair at near 80%\n\nMission Table (Stockpile quantity on 10 Aug 26)  \n754 Oak Log (11466)  \n754 Birch Log (32265)  \n754 Banyan Log (31907)  \n1,006 Willow Log (13290)  \n754 Mahogany Log (19159)  \n754 Lead Bar (4420)  \n754 Steel Bar (4321)  \nRepair Stock: 5 times\n\nEnergizing Pools  \n2,500 Spruce Log (4562)*  \n2,500 Maple Log (36203)  \n1,500 Mystical Log (18338)  \n1,500 Iron Bar (2837)*  \n1,500 Mercury Bar (8306)  \n1,500 Uranium Bar (14154)  \nRepair Stock: 1 times\n\n### | Posted on 20260803 |\n\nMoonlit Festival is happening, end in one week!  \nEnergizing Pools is currently activating, lasting 2 hours+ left before it expire, you can activate the bonus by entering the pool on the guild page.\n\nWith the final exp fillings from the previous raid, our guild has reached Lv 85. We gain 1 more member slot, and 1 more guild challenges.\n\nThank for contributing to guild challenges last week:  \nWrenidall, Minutiae, zerokai, Xazy, Owaeka, Emmibaby, Prosektikos\n\nOur only zerokai is the sole depositors last week who somehow always depositing even though we have stockpile for multiple repairs!\n\nThe Mission Table and Energizing Pools has been repaired last Thursday.\n\n### | Posted on 20260810 |\n\nMoonlit Festival is ending! Wish everyone had their good time with this event. I myself got richer! Huhuhu!\n\nRaid has been scheduled to Floating Garden of Etheria.  \nRaid will now be scheduled a day earlier. I have set up a discord bot for notification 5 mins before raid. You can use this as alarm with @Raid Role.\n\nOur new member, KinSea, joined us 2 days ago, welcome!\n\nThank for contributing to guild challenges last week:  \nWrenidall, Radiumgirl, Yaalt, Minutiae, Owaeka, Eiruna, YapaLeno, Przebiegly, zerokai, G333, Ankewelt, ShadowVoid, Emmibaby\n\nThanks for filling our Stockpile:  \nzerokai, Eiruna, Minutiae, G333",
